<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">A METHOD FOR IMPROVING MULTILINGUAL QUALITY AND DIVERSITY OF INSTRUCTION FINE-TUNING DATASETS</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Chunguang Zhao<sup id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Yilun Liu<sup id="id1.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup">1</sup><sup id="id1.1.1.3" class="ltx_sup">✉</sup>, Pufan Zeng<sup id="id1.1.1.4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,3</span></sup>, Yuanchang Luo<sup id="id1.1.1.5" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>,</span></span>
<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Shimin Tao<sup id="id1.2.1.1" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Minggui He<sup id="id1.2.1.2" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Weibin Meng<sup id="id1.2.1.3" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Song Xu<sup id="id1.2.1.4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,3</span></sup>, Ziang Chen<sup id="id1.2.1.5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>,</span></span>
<span id="id1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Chen Liu<sup id="id1.3.1.1" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Hongxia Ma<sup id="id1.3.1.2" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Li Zhang<sup id="id1.3.1.3" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>, Boxing Chen<sup id="id1.3.1.4" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>, Daimeng Wei<sup id="id1.3.1.5" class="ltx_sup">1</sup></span></span>
</span>
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_correspondence ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span><sup id="id2.1" class="ltx_sup">
<span id="id2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:8.4pt;height:10pt;vertical-align:-2.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.5pt,-0.5pt) scale(1.1,1.1) ;">
